{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019syP4R8XHkxDn6rPz7aNLs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Link 7: Tri Verdict (TOXIC)\n\n**Score: 9/10 — PROD**\n\n**Accomplished this loop (loop 4):**\n- Added 12 new geometry tests across 4 files (mod.zig, sacred.zig, non_euclidean.zig, computational.zig)\n- Total geometry test count: 28 → 40\n- Test coverage gaps filled: Platonic solid volumes/areas, phi-duality, circumradius vs inradius, scaling laws, vesica area, pentagon apothem, spherical excess, hyperbolic defect, haversine real-world distance, convex hull interior exclusion, boundary point behavior\n- All gates passed: build clean, all tests pass, committed on feature branch, pushed\n\n**What the tests verify:**\n1. All 5 Platonic solids produce positive volumes and surface areas\n2. Dodecahedron-icosahedron duality (phi relationship)\n3. Circumradius > inradius for all solids (geometric invariant)\n4. Volume scales as a^3, surface area as a^2 (dimensional analysis)\n5. Vesica piscis area is positive and bounded by circle area\n6. Pentagon apothem < circumradius (geometric necessity)\n7. Pentagon area matches known formula (~1.72 for unit side)\n8. Spherical triangle excess = 90 deg for right-angled equilateral\n9. Hyperbolic triangle defect = 30 deg for (50,50,50) triangle\n10. London-NYC haversine distance ~5570 km (real-world validation)\n11. Convex hull correctly excludes interior points\n12. Boundary point-in-polygon returns ternary value\n\n**Flaws:**\n1. `zig fmt` format warning still present (cosmetic, advisory)\n2. Tests are pure math verification — no CLI integration testing for `tri geom` commands (those would need the binary, hence skip)\n\n**Binary: PROD**\n\n### Tech Tree Options\n\n1. **DEP-001** Docker Container — ROI: 8/10. Would enable running the 4 skipped integration tests in CI\n2. **HW-003** FPGA Acceleration — ROI: 7/10. Native toolchain ready, next: wire to VSA core\n3. **INF-003** KV Cache Integration — ROI: 6/10. Connect ternary KV cache to transformer for inference\n\n---RALPH_STATUS---\nSTATUS: COMPLETE\nBRANCH: ralph/fix-hslm-trainstep\nTASKS_COMPLETED_THIS_LOOP: 2\nFILES_MODIFIED: 5\nBUILD_STATUS: PASS\nTESTS_STATUS: PASSING\nFORMAT_CHECK: NOT_RUN\nHISTORY_CONSULTED: true\nPATTERNS_FOUND: none\nTECH_TREE_NODE: none (geometry tests — fix_plan P1)\nTECH_TREE_UPDATED: false\nWORK_TYPE: TESTING\nEXIT_SIGNAL: true\nRECOMMENDATION: Merge ralph/fix-hslm-trainstep (5 commits: trainStep fix + HSLM sacred scaling + FPGA toolchain + fix_plan + geometry tests)\n---END_RALPH_STATUS---"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":205,"cache_read_input_tokens":146329,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":205,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44d2ecaa-b17e-43c0-bdaa-9bdb8e6b7a9a","uuid":"ea85d6a3-b8d1-464c-8cc9-116263446253"}
